sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant Game
    participant Level
    participant Player
    participant Enemy
    participant HUD as ScoreBoard/HUD

    User->>Game: Press arrow key
    Game->>Level: try_move_player(dr, dc)
    Level->>Player: update position if tile is walkable
    Level-->>Game: LevelResult(points, item status, level status)
    Game->>Player: add points
    Game->>Level: handle_collisions()
    Level-->>Game: collision result
    alt player collects final item
        Game->>Game: advance_level()
    else level continues
        Game->>HUD: redraw score, lives, items left
    end
    Game->>Enemy: move on next tick
